In this post, let's have a look at the power of&nbsp;Distributed Tracing in&nbsp;.NET Isolated Azure Durable Functions. This is one of the new features that got GA like few weeks ago.
First let's have a look at a simple Durable Function and see how it's logged in Application Insights.
